        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>第1問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>1</dt><dd>①</dd></div><div><dt>2</dt><dd>③</dd></div><div><dt>3</dt><dd>⑦</dd></div><div><dt>4</dt><dd>④</dd></div><div><dt>5</dt><dd>①</dd></div><div><dt>6</dt><dd>⑤</dd></div><div><dt>7</dt><dd>⑦</dd></div><div><dt>8</dt><dd>⑤</dd></div><div><dt>9</dt><dd>⑥</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>円運動では中心向きを正にして運動方程式を立て、面から離れる点では垂直抗力を0とします。離脱後は水平・鉛直に分け、力学的エネルギー保存と放物運動を順に接続します。</p></aside><p class=\"prose\">《鉛直面内の円運動と放物運動》</p><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1</h3><p class=\"prose\">円運動の運動方程式をたてると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"m\\frac{v^2}{r}=N-mg\\cos\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"N=m\\frac{v^2}{r}+mg\\cos\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2</h3><p class=\"prose\">（1）<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"C\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> では <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"N=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となるので、円運動の運動方程式をたてると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"m\\frac{v_C^2}{r}=mg\\cos60^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_C=\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\sqrt{gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（2）力学的エネルギー保存則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mv_1^2=\\frac12mv_C^2+mgr(1+\\cos60^\\circ)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{2}\\sqrt{gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問3</h3><p class=\"prose\">（1）鉛直方向に公式を用いて</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"0^2-(v_C\\sin60^\\circ)^2=2(-g)\\left(h-\\frac32r\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"h=\\frac{27}{16}r\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（2）<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"C\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> から床に落下するまでの時間を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、鉛直方向に公式を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"-\\frac32r=v_C\\sin60^\\circ\\cdot t-\\frac12gt^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"gt^2-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\sqrt{gr}\\,t-3r=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t=\\sqrt{\\frac{6r}{g}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">水平方向に公式を用いて</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"r\\sin60^\\circ-v_C\\cos60^\\circ\\cdot t=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "第2問",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>第2問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問4</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"D\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で円運動の運動方程式をたてる。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"N=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_D\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"m\\frac{v_D^2}{r}=mg\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_D^2=gr\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"B\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> での速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、力学的エネルギー保存則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mV^2=\\frac12mv_D^2+mg\\cdot2r\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V=\\sqrt5\\sqrt{gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問5</h3><p class=\"prose\">（1）<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"C\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で面から離れるので、一度床に落下した後の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の速さは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となり、落下前の速さも <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる。つまり、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"D\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> での速さも <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる。力学的エネルギー保存則を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mv_2^2=\\frac12mv_1^2+mg\\cdot2r\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}{2}\\sqrt{gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（2）<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"D\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> から床に落下するまでの時間を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、鉛直方向に公式を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2r=\\frac12gt&#39;^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t&#39;=2\\sqrt{\\frac rg}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">水平方向に公式を用いて</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_1t&#39;=\\sqrt{14}\\,r\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問6</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"B\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2r\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 離れた点に落下するときの <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"D\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> での速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_D&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、水平方向に公式を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-443227253d8d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問6</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2r=v_D&#39;t&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-443227253d8d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問6</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_D&#39;=\\sqrt{gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"D\\to\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>床で水平方向の運動エネルギーは一定であり、衝突しても変化しないので衝突により失うのは2回分の重力による位置エネルギーの減少分</p><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\\times2mgr\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる。エネルギーの関係より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-443227253d8d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問6</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12mv_3^2=\\frac12mv_D&#39;^2+4mgr\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-443227253d8d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問6</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_3=3\\sqrt{gr}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>10</dt><dd>⑧</dd></div><div><dt>11</dt><dd>⑨</dd></div><div><dt>12</dt><dd>④</dd></div><div><dt>13</dt><dd>⑦</dd></div><div><dt>14</dt><dd>⑦</dd></div><div><dt>15</dt><dd>⑥</dd></div><div><dt>16</dt><dd>③</dd></div><div><dt>17</dt><dd>⑧</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>状態I〜IVごとに圧力・体積・温度を整理します。準静的断熱変化ではポアソン則、非準静的な圧縮では状態方程式と熱力学第1法則を使い分けます。</p></aside><p class=\"prose\">《理想気体の断熱変化》</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1</h3><p class=\"prose\">状態IIの圧力を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"p_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_aV_0^{5/3}=p_2\\left(\\frac12V_0\\right)^{5/3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_2=2^{5/3}p_a\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">ピストンの力のつりあいより</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_2S=p_aS+Mg\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"M=(2^{5/3}-1)\\frac{p_aS}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2</h3><p class=\"prose\">内部エネルギーの変化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_2=\\frac32p_2\\frac12V_0-\\frac32p_aV_0=\\frac32(2^{2/3}-1)p_aV_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問3</h3><p class=\"prose\">手の力がした仕事を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、断熱変化なので、熱力学第1法則より、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と大気圧による力がした仕事 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"p_a(\\frac12V_0)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の和が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> に等しい。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"W+p_a\\left(\\frac12V_0\\right)=\\Delta U_2\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"W=\\Delta U_2-p_a\\frac12V_0=\\frac32(2^{2/3}-1)p_aV_0-\\frac12p_aV_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=\\left\\{3\\left(\\frac12\\right)^{1/3}-2\\right\\}p_aV_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問4</h3><p class=\"prose\">（1）状態IIIでの圧力を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"p_3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと、ピストンの力のつりあいより</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_3S=p_aS+M&#39;g\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_3=p_a+\\frac{M&#39;g}{S}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">状態方程式をたてると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"nRT_{III}=p_3\\frac12V_0=\\left(p_a+\\frac{M&#39;g}{S}\\right)\\frac{V_0}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（2）大気と重力による仕事の和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W_3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9cc325756b01\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問4</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"W_3=p_a\\frac12V_0+M&#39;g\\frac{V_0}{2S}=\\left(p_a+\\frac{M&#39;g}{S}\\right)\\frac{V_0}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問5</h3><p class=\"prose\">内部エネルギーの変化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_3=\\frac32p_3\\frac12V_0-\\frac32p_aV_0=\\frac32V_0\\left(\\frac{M&#39;g}{2S}-\\frac12p_a\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">熱力学第1法則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_3=W_3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac32V_0\\left(\\frac{M&#39;g}{2S}-\\frac12p_a\\right)=\\left(p_a+\\frac{M&#39;g}{S}\\right)\\frac{V_0}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-9f624f149f50\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問5</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"M&#39;=5\\frac{p_aS}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問6</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"M&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を問4（1）の式に代入して</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-443227253d8d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問6</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"nRT_{III}=\\left(p_a+\\frac{p_aS}{S}\\cdot5\\right)\\frac{V_0}{2}=3p_aV_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-443227253d8d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問6</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"T_{III}=3T_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問7</h3><p class=\"prose\">状態IVの絶対温度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"T_4\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。ポアソンの断熱変化の式を用いて</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-ab5432d669e7\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問7</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"T_4(V_0)^{2/3}=3T_0\\left(\\frac12V_0\\right)^{2/3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-ab5432d669e7\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問7</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"T_4=3\\left(\\frac12\\right)^{2/3}T_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "第3問",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>第3問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>18</dt><dd>④</dd></div><div><dt>19</dt><dd>③</dd></div><div><dt>20</dt><dd>⑨</dd></div><div><dt>21</dt><dd>⑨</dd></div><div><dt>22</dt><dd>②</dd></div><div><dt>23</dt><dd>①</dd></div><div><dt>24</dt><dd>③</dd></div><div><dt>25</dt><dd>⑨</dd></div><div><dt>26</dt><dd>③</dd></div><div><dt>27</dt><dd>③</dd></div><div><dt>28</dt><dd>④</dd></div><div><dt>29</dt><dd>⑧</dd></div><div><dt>30</dt><dd>⑦</dd></div><div><dt>31</dt><dd>④</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>まず電場ベクトルを重ね合わせ、電位は電場と逆向きに増えることから式を作ります。点電荷の運動はエネルギー、力積、等加速度運動をx・y成分へ分けて追います。</p></aside><p class=\"prose\">《一様な電場と電位》</p><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問1</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\vec E_A=(-3.0, 0)\\,[\\mathrm{V/m}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（2）電位差＝電場の強さ×距離となる。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 軸正の向きのほうが電位が高いことから</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-dedf4e2abf34\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問1</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_A=3.0x+0\\times y+0\\,[\\mathrm V]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問2</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\vec E_{AB}=(-3.0, -4.0)\\,[\\mathrm{V/m}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（2）電位は和になるので、問1（2）と同様に</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-45dae1cd1f7f\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問2</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_{AB}=3.0x+4.0y+0\\,[\\mathrm V]\\qquad\\cdots(i)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>問3</h3><p class=\"prose\">（1）<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"i\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>に <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(x,y)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を代入して</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_{AB}=3.0\\times3.0\\times10^{-3}+4.0\\times(-1.0\\times10^{-3})=5.0\\times10^{-3}\\,[\\mathrm V]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">静電気力による位置エネルギー <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"U_{AB}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"U_{AB}=4.0\\times10^{-8}\\times5.0\\times10^{-3}=2.0\\times10^{-10}\\,[\\mathrm J]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（2）<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、エネルギー保存則を考えると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac12\\times1.0\\times10^{-10}v^2=2.0\\times10^{-10}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v=2.0\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（3）静止した状態から運動するので</p><p class=\"prose\">（速さ）：（速さの <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分）：（速さの <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分）<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"=5:3:4\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></p><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 方向の速度成分を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 方向の速度成分を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> はともに負となるので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_x=-2.0\\times\\frac35=-1.2\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}],\\qquad v_y=-2.0\\times\\frac45=-1.6\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（力積）＝（運動量の変化）なので、力積の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I_x, I_y\\,[\\mathrm{N\\cdot s}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とし</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"I_x=1.0\\times10^{-10}\\times(-1.2)=-1.2\\times10^{-10}\\,[\\mathrm{N\\cdot s}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"I_y=1.0\\times10^{-10}\\times(-1.6)=-1.6\\times10^{-10}\\,[\\mathrm{N\\cdot s}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">（4）加速度の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分をそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a_x, a_y\\,[\\mathrm{m/s^2}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき、運動方程式をたてると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"1.0\\times10^{-10}a_x=4.0\\times10^{-8}\\times(-3.0),\\qquad a_x=-1.2\\times10^3\\,[\\mathrm{m/s^2}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"1.0\\times10^{-10}a_y=4.0\\times10^{-8}\\times(-4.0),\\qquad a_y=-1.6\\times10^3\\,[\\mathrm{m/s^2}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">公式を用いて</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(-1.2)^2-0^2=2(-1.2\\times10^3)(x-3.0\\times10^{-3})\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x=2.4\\times10^{-3}\\,[\\mathrm m]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(-1.6)^2-0^2=2(-1.6\\times10^3){y-(-1.0\\times10^{-3})}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8b1029446a7e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">問3</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"y=-1.8\\times10^{-3}\\,[\\mathrm m]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
  },
